    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1306-a1">

                <pb facs="1038" n="922" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg922"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Representatives of the Railway
                            Men to the American
                    Ambassador</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mexico, D. F.</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-04-16">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 16, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Sir</hi>: For your information will state that
                    to-morrow something over 600 engineers and conductors will leave the service of
                    the National Railways of Mexico. It will be a part of the duty of the
                    undersigned to know where these men have located. If their services should be
                    needed by our country in handling troop trains in the Republic of Mexico we will
                    be able to furnish all the men needed and these men will thoroughly know the
                    track they are to run over.</p>
                <p>A wire or letter to T. K. Eccles, Alberta Hotel, El Paso, Texas, will be all that
                    is needed.</p>
                <p>Very sincerely yours,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <list>
                            <item>
                                <hi rendition="#small-caps">T. K. Eccles</hi>.</item>
                            <item>
                                <hi rendition="#small-caps">J. F. Ealy.</hi>
                            </item>
                        </list>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
